{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">尖沙咀一座商業大廈收到可疑信件，警方爆炸品處理課到場處理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LETTER-1230.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RiqUddBbt71791261893.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LETTER-1230.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事的是位於堪富利士道的時財商業大廈，警員圍封大廈出入口，有警員戴上防毒面具，警方炸彈處理課人員亦到場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LETTER-1230_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ed0KHwU0Eb1791261891.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LETTER-1230_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方上午約9時半，接獲大廈管理處職員報案，指收到一封信件含恐嚇字句及白色粉末。現場消息指，初步鑑定粉末是麵粉。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T05:19:25.526941+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}